{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100024","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100024/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100024/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100024/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100024","id":2718781124,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6EGJqT","number":100024,"title":"Optimize string single char contains calls.","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","color":"aaccff","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097966,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc5NjY=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:core","name":"topic:core","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":3240950060,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwzMjQwOTUwMDYw","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/performance","name":"performance","color":"447777","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/20","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/20/labels","id":10558797,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4AoR1N","number":20,"title":"4.4","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":8,"closed_issues":4466,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-02-14T11:52:07Z","updated_at":"2026-10-05T23:48:31Z","due_on":"2025-03-03T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-03-19T09:35:35Z"},"comments":14,"created_at":"2024-12-04T21:02:55Z","updated_at":"2026-02-07T12:34:46Z","closed_at":"2024-12-09T20:36:39Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/100024","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100024","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100024.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100024.patch","merged_at":"2024-12-09T20:36:39Z"},"body":"Here's why it's important to optimize single-char calls:\r\n\r\n- `contains` is easier to compute for single-char strings, because no nested loops are needed. It may even be SIMD vectorized with a good and / or compiler.\r\n- There are a _lot_ of callers to these functions. Every one of these benefits a bit from this optimization, lubricating the gears.\r\n\r\n### For reviewers\r\n\r\nThe PR is more simple than it seems.\r\nAlmost all changes are search and replace with regex and should be correct, like:\r\n- find `contains\\(\"(\\\\?.)\"\"`, replace with `contains_char('$1')`\r\n\r\nThe exception is `ustring.cpp` (and `ustring.h`), where the optimization is being dispatched.\r\n\r\n\r\n### Old Version\r\n\r\nParts of this PR were duplicate / alternative solutions to https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92475. I have since consolidated this one to only feature the optimized `contains` calls. single-char `replace` calls will be discussed and finalized in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/92475.\r\n\r\n<details>\r\n\r\n<summary>Old Description</summary>\r\n\r\nHere's why it's important to optimize single-char calls:\r\n\r\n- both `replace` and `contains` are much easier to compute for single-char strings, because no nested loops are needed. It may even be SIMD vectorized with a good and / or compiler.\r\n- There are a _lot_ of callers to these functions. Every one of these benefits a bit from this optimization, lubricating the gears.\r\n- `replace` with string arguments copies the data even if there are no other `CowData` co-owners. It also iterates the array twice. This can be exploited by `ustring.cpp` (although not from elsewhere, because `string.replace` makes a copy anyway).\r\n\r\nThis PR depends on (and includes) #100015.\r\n\r\nI don't have a benchmark yet, but I believe the single-char replace and contains functions should be several times faster than the full string ones.\r\n\r\n### For reviewers\r\n\r\nThe PR is more simple than it seems.\r\nAlmost all changes are search and replace with regex and should be correct, like:\r\n- find `replace\\(\"(\\\\?.)\", \"(\\\\?.)\"`, replace with `replace('$1', '$2')`\r\n- same for `contains`, similar for `find`\r\n\r\nThe exceptions are:\r\n- `cowdata.h`, where `replace` is implemented.\r\n- `ustring.cpp` where some algorithms are optimized to make better use of the function.\r\n\r\n</details>","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100024/reactions","total_count":21,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":5,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":8,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100024/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}